<plan steps="Client|Edge|LB|API"/>Sure. It starts in the <node id="client" label="Browser" kind="actor"/>browser, then <step n="2"/>hits the <node id="cdn" label="CDN" near="client"/><edge from="client" to="cdn"/>CDN at the edge. Then the <step n="3"/><node id="lb" label="Load balancer" near="cdn"/><edge from="cdn" to="lb"/>load balancer spreads it across <node id="api" label="API pod" near="lb" stack="3"/><edge from="lb" to="api"/>three API pods. Before touching Postgres, the service checks <node id="redis" label="Redis" kind="db" near="api" dir="below"/>Redis.
